{"title":"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_cutoffchaser(SIMPLE_AND_STRAIGHTFORWARD)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by cutoffchaser(SIMPLE AND STRAIGHTFORWARD)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>For what value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> does <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/0/f20a8e2deb823896ee3fcdac38de7ae52f1fb42b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{x}\\cdot 100^{2x}=1000^{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"148\" height=\"15\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/f/eefb164682b5c68e13f8eac4b682fdc58485673e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 1 \\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 2\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 3\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 4\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"348\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can rewrite <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/2/0/f20a8e2deb823896ee3fcdac38de7ae52f1fb42b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{x}\\cdot 100^{2x}=1000^{5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"148\" height=\"15\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/d/6/7d66882f3552f06b16e0329a02da2ff91d3b9e68.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10^{5x}=10^{15}$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"88\" height=\"15\" />:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/d/79d64c5be65781d58e39c297545f5c2ceb9ba6f5.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\begin{split} 10^x\\cdot100^{2x} &amp; =10^x\\cdot(10^2)^{2x} \\\\ 10^x\\cdot10^{4x} &amp; =(10^3)^5 \\\\ 10^{5x} &amp; =10^{15} \\end{split}\\]\" width=\"197\" height=\"70\" />\nSince the bases are equal, we can set the exponents equal, giving us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/5/8a50ea624703ad0d8ea25ac8f7b5a7cfdf618ec8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />. Solving the equation gives us <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/f/98f4c4505833bdd0802ba93838c7952c7647fd1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\;3}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"92\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can rewrite this expression as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/e/1ae1705a7db891d9685d4faf4b223ee2c1d15d81.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log(10^x \\cdot 100^{2x})=\\log(1000^5)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"223\" height=\"19\" /> , which can be simplified to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/e/9ae7032523267efeda48d7da5cf0b714b9135547.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log(10^{x}\\cdot10^{4x})=5\\log(1000)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"219\" height=\"19\" />, and that can be further simplified to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/1/301eabe578471bac269664c20833df5a14ea3015.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log(10^{5x})=5\\log(10^3)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"169\" height=\"19\" /> . This leads to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/5/8a50ea624703ad0d8ea25ac8f7b5a7cfdf618ec8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5x=15$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"61\" height=\"13\" />. Solving this linear equation yields <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/f/98f4c4505833bdd0802ba93838c7952c7647fd1e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\boxed{\\textbf{(C)}\\;3}.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"92\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<pre><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/-U6n2jBDqSA\">https://youtu.be/-U6n2jBDqSA</a>\n</pre>\n<p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/VIt6LnkV4_w?t=044\">https://youtu.be/VIt6LnkV4_w?t=044</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/SZNMHoYzPDs\">https://youtu.be/SZNMHoYzPDs</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_by_cutoffchaser.28SIMPLE_AND_STRAIGHTFORWARD.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_cutoffchaser(SIMPLE_AND_STRAIGHTFORWARD)\">Video Solution by cutoffchaser(SIMPLE AND STRAIGHTFORWARD)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by cutoffchaser(SIMPLE AND STRAIGHTFORWARD)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8VfQis1otv0\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=8VfQis1otv0</a>\n</p><p>~piHard\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A\">2016 AMC 10A</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Answer_Key\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2016 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.ph